INSERT INTO `wp_posts` VALUES (734,1,'2026-02-08 16:21:09','2026-02-08 16:21:09','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>12/06/2023</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:image -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img src=\"https://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/7.jpg\" alt=\"\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>At the Center for Culture, we marked June 1st — Children’s Day.<br>An artistic performance symbolically presenting Alphabet Book Day was performed by the students of class II-4 from the elementary school “Toli Zordumis,” under the mentorship of their teacher Zejnepe Bajrami.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Today at the Center for Culture in Kumanovo, two important and symbolic holidays were celebrated — “Alphabet Book Day” and Children’s Day, June 1st.<br>The performers were the students of class II-4 from the elementary school “Toli Zordumis,” under the guidance of teacher Zejnepe Bajrami.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><img width=\"640\" height=\"427\" srcset=\"https://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/1-1024x683.jpg 1024w, https://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/1-300x200.jpg 300w, https://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/1-768x512.jpg 768w\" src=\"http://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/1-1024x683.jpg\" alt=\"\"> <img width=\"640\" height=\"427\" srcset=\"https://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/2-1024x683.jpg 1024w, https://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/2-300x200.jpg 300w, https://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/2-768x512.jpg 768w\" src=\"http://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/2-1024x683.jpg\" alt=\"\"> <img width=\"640\" height=\"427\" srcset=\"https://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/3-1024x683.jpg 1024w, https://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/3-300x200.jpg 300w, https://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/3-768x512.jpg 768w\" src=\"http://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/3-1024x683.jpg\" alt=\"\"> <img width=\"640\" height=\"960\" srcset=\"https://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/4-683x1024.jpg 683w, https://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/4-200x300.jpg 200w, https://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/4-768x1152.jpg 768w, https://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/4.jpg 1365w\" src=\"http://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/4-683x1024.jpg\" alt=\"\"> <img width=\"640\" height=\"960\" srcset=\"https://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/5-683x1024.jpg 683w, https://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/5-200x300.jpg 200w, https://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/5-768x1152.jpg 768w, https://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/5.jpg 1365w\" src=\"http://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/5-683x1024.jpg\" alt=\"\"> <img width=\"640\" height=\"427\" srcset=\"https://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/6-1024x683.jpg 1024w, https://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/6-300x200.jpg 300w, https://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/6-768x512.jpg 768w\" src=\"http://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/6-1024x683.jpg\" alt=\"\"> <img width=\"640\" height=\"427\" srcset=\"https://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/7-1024x683.jpg 1024w, https://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/7-300x200.jpg 300w, https://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/7-768x512.jpg 768w\" src=\"http://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/7-1024x683.jpg\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','Children’s Day','','publish','open','open','','childrens-day','','','2026-02-08 16:21:09','2026-02-08 16:21:09','',0,'https://user17.delovna.finki.ukim.mk/?p=734',0,'post','',0);
INSERT INTO `wp_posts` VALUES (735,1,'2026-02-08 16:21:09','2026-02-08 16:21:09','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>12/06/2023</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:image -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img src=\"https://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/7.jpg\" alt=\"\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>At the Center for Culture, we marked June 1st — Children’s Day.<br>An artistic performance symbolically presenting Alphabet Book Day was performed by the students of class II-4 from the elementary school “Toli Zordumis,” under the mentorship of their teacher Zejnepe Bajrami.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Today at the Center for Culture in Kumanovo, two important and symbolic holidays were celebrated — “Alphabet Book Day” and Children’s Day, June 1st.<br>The performers were the students of class II-4 from the elementary school “Toli Zordumis,” under the guidance of teacher Zejnepe Bajrami.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><img width=\"640\" height=\"427\" srcset=\"https://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/1-1024x683.jpg 1024w, https://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/1-300x200.jpg 300w, https://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/1-768x512.jpg 768w\" src=\"http://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/1-1024x683.jpg\" alt=\"\"> <img width=\"640\" height=\"427\" srcset=\"https://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/2-1024x683.jpg 1024w, https://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/2-300x200.jpg 300w, https://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/2-768x512.jpg 768w\" src=\"http://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/2-1024x683.jpg\" alt=\"\"> <img width=\"640\" height=\"427\" srcset=\"https://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/3-1024x683.jpg 1024w, https://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/3-300x200.jpg 300w, https://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/