ev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/4.jpg 1600w\">&nbsp;<img src=\"http://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/5-1024x682.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"640\" height=\"426\" srcset=\"https://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/5-1024x682.jpg 1024w, https://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/5-300x200.jpg 300w, https://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/5-768x512.jpg 768w, https://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/5.jpg 1600w\">Денеска го реализиравме проектот насловен „Моќта на уметноста на нашиот ум“.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Се чувствуваме почестени од присуството на нашите професори, кои ги споделија со нас нивните професионални и педагошки вредности на предавањето во НУЦК „Трајко Прокопиев“ Куманово.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Ви благодариме на сите за учеството!</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Sot realizuam projektin me titull „Fuqia e artit mbi mendjen tonë”.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Ndjehemi të nderuar me prezencën e Profesorëve tanë, të cilët ndanë me ne vlerat e tyre profesionale dhe pedagogjike gjatë ligjërimit në INQK „Trajko Prokopiev” Kumanovë.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Ju faleminderit të gjithve për pjesëmarrjen!</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','Моќта на уметноста над нашиот ум Семинар.Fuqia e artit mbi mendjen tonë – Seminar','','inherit','closed','closed','','777-revision-v1','','','2026-02-08 16:37:49','2026-02-08 16:37:49','',777,'https://user17.delovna.finki.ukim.mk/?p=779',0,'revision','',0);
INSERT INTO `wp_posts` VALUES (780,1,'2026-02-08 16:38:19','2026-02-08 16:38:19','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>03/05/2023</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:image -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img src=\"https://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/1.jpg\" alt=\"\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><img width=\"640\" height=\"905\" srcset=\"https://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/1-724x1024.jpg 724w, https://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/1-212x300.jpg 212w, https://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/1-768x1086.jpg 768w, https://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/1.jpg 1131w\" src=\"http://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/1-724x1024.jpg\" alt=\"\"> <img width=\"640\" height=\"905\" srcset=\"https://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/2-724x1024.jpg 724w, https://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/2-212x300.jpg 212w, https://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/2-768x1086.jpg 768w, https://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/2.jpg 1131w\" src=\"http://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/2-724x1024.jpg\" alt=\"\"> <img width=\"640\" height=\"853\" srcset=\"https://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/3-768x1024.jpg 768w, https://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/3-225x300.jpg 225w, https://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/3.jpg 1200w\" src=\"http://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/3-768x1024.jpg\" alt=\"\"> <img width=\"640\" height=\"426\" srcset=\"https://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/4-1024x682.jpg 1024w, https://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/4-300x200.jpg 300w, https://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/4-768x512.jpg 768w, https://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/4.jpg 1600w\" src=\"http://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/4-1024x682.jpg\" alt=\"\"> <img width=\"640\" height=\"426\" srcset=\"https://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/5-1024x682.jpg 1024w, https://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/5-300x200.jpg 300w, https://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/5-768x512.jpg 768w, https://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/5.jpg 1600w\" src=\"http://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/5-1024x682.jpg\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Today we carried out the project titled “The Power of Art Over Our Mind.”<br>We feel honored by the presence of our professors, who shared with us their professional and pedagogical values during the lecture at NUCC “Trajko Prokopiev” Kumanovo.<br>Thank you all for your participation!</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Today we realized the project titled “The Power of Art Over Our Mind.”<br>We are honored by the presence of our professors, who shared their professional and pedagogical values with us during the lecture at NUCC “Trajko Prokopiev” Kumanovo.<br>Thank you all for participating!</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','The Power of Art Over Our Mind — Seminar','','publish','open','open','','the-power-of-art-over-our-mind-seminar','','','2026-02-08 16:38:19','2026-02-08 16:38:19','',0,'https://user17.delovna.finki.ukim.mk/?p=780',0,'post','',0);
INSERT INTO `wp_posts` VALUES (781,1,'2026-02-08 16:38:19','2026-02-08 16:38:19','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>03/05/2023</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:image -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img src=\"https://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/1.jpg\" alt=\"\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><img width=\"640\" height=\"905\" srcset=\"https://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/1-724x1024.jpg 724w, https://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/1-212x300.jpg 212w, https://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/1-768x1086.jpg 768w, https://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/1.jpg 1131w\" src=\"http://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/1-724x1024.jpg\" alt=\"\"> <img width=\"640\" height=\"905\" srcset=\"https://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/2-724x1024.jpg 724w, https://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/2-212x300.jpg 212w, https://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/2-768x1086.jpg 768w, https://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/2.jpg 1131w\" src=\"http://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/2-724x1024.jpg\" alt=\"\"> <img width=\"640\" height=\"853\" srcset=\"https://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/3-768x1024.jpg 768w, https://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/3-225x300.jpg 225w, https://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/3.jpg 1200w\" src=\"http://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/3-768x1024.jpg\" alt=\"\"> <img width=\"640\" height=\"426\" srcset=\"https://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/4-1024x682.jpg 1024w, https://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/4-300x200.jpg 300w, https://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/4-768x512.jpg 768w, https://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/4.jpg 1600w\" src=\"http://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/4-1024x682.jpg\" alt=\"\"> <img width=\"640\" height=\"426\" srcset=\"https://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/5-1024x682.jpg 1024w, https://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/5-300x200.jpg 300w, https://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/5-768x512.jpg 768w, https://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/5.jpg 1600w\" src=\"http://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/5-1024x682.jpg\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Today we carried out the project titled “The Power of Art Over Our Mind.”<br>We feel honored by the presence of our professors, who shared with us their professional and pedagogical values during the lecture at NUCC “Trajko Prokopiev” Kumanovo.<br>Thank you all for your participation!</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Today we realized the project titled “The Power of Art Over Our Mind.”<br>We are honored by the presence of our professors, who shared their professional and pedagogical values with us during the lecture at NUCC “Trajko Prokopiev” Kumanovo.<br>Thank you all for participating!</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','The Power of Art Over Our Mind — Seminar','','inherit','closed','closed','','780-revision-v1','','','2026-02-08 16:38:19','2026-02-08 16:38:19','',780,'https://user17.delovna.finki.ukim.mk/?p=781',0,'revision','',0);
INSERT INTO `wp_posts` VALUES (782,1,'2026-02-08 16:39:07','2026-02-08 16:39:07','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>24/04/2023</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:image -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img src=\"https://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/7-3.jpg\" alt=\"\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Наскоро, во јуни.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Гостување на Национална опера и балет во Куманово.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Магичната балетска претстава „ПЕПЕЛАШКА“</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Современа бајка за сите возрасти.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Таа живее во дом во кој никој не ја сака, но соништата не ја напуштаат.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Со помош на мудрите Вили и малку магија, таа е спремна за бал на кој не е повикана. На балот е омилената и најубава девојка, во која сите момчиња се вљубени, таму е и тој вистинскиот – нејзиниот принц од соништата. Правилото е дека сите добри девојки мораат пред полноќ да бидат во своите домови. Опиена од танц, смеа, од принцот…</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Наскоро ќе објавиме кога започнува продажбата на билети.<img src=\"http://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/1-5-1024x683.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"640\" height=\"427\" srcset=\"https://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/1-5-1024x683.jpg 1024w, https://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/1-5-300x200.jpg 300w, https://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/1-5-768x512.jpg 768w\">&nbsp;<img src=\"http://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/2-5-1024x683.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"640\" height=\"427\" srcset=\"https://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/2-5-1024x683.jpg 1024w, https://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/2-5-300x200.jpg 300w, https://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/2-5-768x512.jpg 768w\">&nbsp;<img src=\"http://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/3-5-1024x683.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"640\" height=\"427\" srcset=\"https://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/3-5-1024x683.jpg 1024w, https://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/3-5-300x200.jpg 300w, https://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/3-5-768x512.jpg 768w\">&nbsp;<img src=\"http://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/4-4-1024x683.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"640\" height=\"427\" srcset=\"https://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/4-4-1024x683.jpg 1024w, https://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/4-4-300x200.jpg 300w, https://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/4-4-768x512.jpg 768w\">&nbsp;<img src=\"http://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/5-4-1024x683.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"640\" height=\"427\" srcset=\"https://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/5-4-1024x683.jpg 1024w, https://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/5-4-300x200.jpg 300w, https://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/5-4-768x512.jpg 768w\">&nbsp;<img src=\"http://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/6-3-1024x683.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"640\" height=\"427\" srcset=\"https://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/6-3-1024x683.jpg 1024w, https://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/6-3-300x200.jpg 300w, https://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/6-3-768x512.jpg 768w\">&nbsp;<img src=\"http://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/7-3.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"640\" height=\"251\" srcset=\"https://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/7-3.jpg 960w, https://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/7-3-300x118.jpg 300w, https://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/7-3-768x301.jpg 768w\"></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','Гостување на НОБ со балетската претстава „Пепелашка“','','publish','open','open','','%d0%b3%d0%be%d1%81%d1%82%d1%83%d0%b2%d0%b0%d1%9a%d0%b5-%d0%bd%d0%b0-%d0%bd%d0%be%d0%b1-%d1%81%d0%be-%d0%b1%d0%b0%d0%bb%d0%b5%d1%82%d1%81%d0%ba%d0%b0%d1%82%d0%b0-%d0%bf%d1%80%d0%b5%d1%82%d1%81%d1%82','','','2026-02-08 16:39:07','2026-02-08 16:39:07','',0,'https://user17.delovna.finki.ukim.mk/?p=782',0,'post','',0);
