 треба да се унапредува културната соработка.</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Младинскиот оркестар брои над 15 члена, а неговиот инструментариум е составен од вокални солисти, бас-гитара, соло-гитара, акустична гитара, клавијатури, саксофон, кларинет, кавал, хармоника, кахон, тарамбука, виолина, труба, тромбон.</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Покрај композициите што се пеат, оркестарот изведува и композиции во форма на џез стандарди, преработки на песни во инструментална форма и преработки на песни од традиционалната македонска музика.</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Оркестарот е формиран во 2020 година и работи под уметничко раководство на Александар Митрички, Мима Младеновска – вокал и Филип Гелевски – вокал.&nbsp;</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":5181} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img src=\"http://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2022/05/280547711_3198647133753279_8223758290952102294_n-1024x768.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-5181\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":5182} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img src=\"http://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2022/05/280644306_3198647110419948_3754411764879977538_n-1024x768.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-5182\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":5183} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img src=\"http://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2022/05/280732303_3198647173753275_5821478391244768562_n-1024x768.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-5183\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":5184} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img src=\"http://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2022/05/280788831_3198647153753277_5617826323946464520_n-1024x768.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-5184\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->','Настап на Младинскиот оркестар при НУЦК во Културниот Центар во Софија','','inherit','closed','closed','','812-revision-v1','','','2026-02-08 16:45:30','2026-02-08 16:45:30','',812,'https://user17.delovna.finki.ukim.mk/?p=814',0,'revision','',0);
INSERT INTO `wp_posts` VALUES (815,1,'2026-02-08 16:46:01','2026-02-08 16:46:01','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>17/05/2022</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:image -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img src=\"https://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2022/05/Muzika-nema-granici-Bugarija.jpg\" alt=\"\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>At the Macedonian Cultural and Information Center in Sofia, the concert “Music Has No Borders” was held, performed by the Youth Orchestra of the Center for Culture “Trajko Prokopiev” from Kumanovo, reported MIA’s correspondent from Sofia.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The orchestra performed many popular Macedonian songs, as well as rock music, arrangements of Macedonian evergreens, and folk songs.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The orchestra’s program included musical pieces associated with performances by Karolina Gočeva, Toše Proeski, Aleksandar Mitevski and Dragan Spasov Dac, Vlatko Stefanovski, Area, Kuku Lele, Non Stop, Aleksandra Janeva, Zijan, Ana Kostovska, as well as jazz arrangements of well-known Macedonian folk songs and songs from the Kumanovo region.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Visitors in the packed hall of the Cultural and Information Center in Sofia rewarded the orchestra with long applause.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The orchestra’s artistic director from Kumanovo, Aleksandar Mitrički, told MIA that they gave their best and were happy that the Sofia audience recognized it.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>“The atmosphere was wonderful for both the performers and the musicians. The songs were received excellently,” said Mitrički.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>He added that art and music connect people and that this concert is an example that cultural cooperation should be further strengthened.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The Youth Orchestra has more than 15 members, and its instrumentation includes vocal soloists, bass guitar, lead guitar, acoustic guitar, keyboards, saxophone, clarinet, kaval, accordion, cajón, darbuka, violin, trumpet, and trombone.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>In addition to vocal pieces, the orchestra also performs compositions in the form of jazz standards, instrumental arrangements, and arrangements of traditional Macedonian music.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The orchestra was founded in 2020 and works under the artistic direction of Aleksandar Mitrički, Mima Mladenovska — vocal, and Filip Gelevski — vocal.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":5181} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img src=\"http://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2022/05/280547711_3198647133753279_8223758290952102294_n-1024x768.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-5181\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":5182} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img src=\"http://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2022/05/280644306_3198647110419948_3754411764879977538_n-1024x768.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-5182\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":5183} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img src=\"http://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2022/05/280732303_3198647173753275_5821478391244768562_n-1024x768.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-5183\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":5184} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img src=\"http://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2022/05/280788831_3198647153753277_5617826323946464520_n-1024x768.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-5184\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->','Performance of the Youth Orchestra of NUCC at the Cultural Center in Sofia','','publish','open','open','','performance-of-the-youth-orchestra-of-nucc-at-the-cultural-center-in-sofia','','','2026-02-08 16:46:01','2026-02-08 16:46:01','',0,'https://user17.delovna.finki.ukim.mk/?p=815',0,'post','',0);
