гарија, Америка, Израел и кај нас.<br>Во Септември минатата година Ева Богоевска одржа солистички концерт во Театарот Марчело во Рим, Италија, а оваа година ќе одржи солистички концерт во Париз, Франција.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>ЉУБИЦА ДЕЛЕВА</strong>&nbsp;родена на 16.09.1995, редовен студент на четврта година при факултетот за музичка уметност во Скопје, во класата на проф. мр. Олег Кондратенко. Добитник на бројни награди нмеѓународни и државни натпревари меѓу кои и Лауреат на меѓународниот натпревар во Аранѓеловац и два Лауреати на Државниот натпревар во Скопје. Бројни настапи на концерти како солист со Македонска Филхармонија, Скопско лето, Охридско лето, а и други фестивали и концерти организирани од факултетот за музичка уметност, како и средното музичко училиште ДМБУЦ “Илија Николовски – Луј“.<br>Во 2016 успешно положува аудиција во оркестарот за снимање филмска музика F.A.M.E.S. Orcestral recording, и е редовенчлен во многубројни проекти. Истата година положува аудиција за хонорарец во Македонска Опера и Балет и е редовен член. Во 2017 успешно положува аудиција за хонорарец во Македонската Филхармонија и учествува на многубројни концерти со светски познати солисти и под диригентска палка на светски познати диригенти.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>ОЛЕГ ЦИНГАРСКИ</strong>&nbsp;е роден во 2001 во Скопје. Во својата деветта година започнува со музичко образование и концертно настапување во ДМБУЦ “Илија Николовски- Луј”. Изучува виолончело во класата на проф. Драган Гоневски. Има освоено први, втори и трети награди на државни и меѓународни натпревари во Македонија, Србија, Бугарија и Република Чешка, а има посетувано и голем број мастеркласи и семинари во Црна Гора, Албанија и Чешка.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":2656} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img src=\"http://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2018/06/Eva-Bogoevska-violin.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-2656\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":2659} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img src=\"http://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2018/06/%D0%95%D0%B2%D0%B0-%D0%91%D0%BE%D0%B3%D0%BE%D0%B5%D0%B2%D1%81%D0%BA%D0%B0.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-2659\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":2660} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img src=\"http://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2018/06/%D0%89%D1%83%D0%B1%D0%B8%D1%86%D0%B0-%D0%94%D0%B5%D0%BB%D0%B5%D0%B2%D0%B0.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-2660\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":2661} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img src=\"http://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2018/06/%D0%9E%D0%BB%D0%B5%D0%B3-%D0%A6%D0%B8%D0%BD%D0%B3%D0%B0%D1%80%D1%81%D0%BA%D0%B8-1024x681.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-2661\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->','КОНЦЕРТ – ТРИО АУРОРА 11.06.2018 ПОНЕДЕЛНИК МАЛА САЛА 20ч.','','inherit','closed','closed','','1060-revision-v1','','','2026-02-08 18:52:39','2026-02-08 18:52:39','',1060,'https://user17.delovna.finki.ukim.mk/?p=1062',0,'revision','',0);
INSERT INTO `wp_posts` VALUES (1063,1,'2026-02-08 18:53:20','2026-02-08 18:53:20','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>05/06/2018</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:image -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img src=\"https://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2018/06/TELOP-AURORA.jpg\" alt=\"\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>TRIO AURORA</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Eva Bogoevska — violin<br>Ljubica Deleva — violin<br>Oleg Cingarski — cello</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>PROGRAM</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>– W. A. Mozart — “A Little Night Music”<br>• Allegro<br>• Romance (Andante)<br>• Menuet (Allegretto)<br>• Rondo (Allegro)<br>– L. Boccherini — “Minuet”<br>– J. Pachelbel — “Canon”<br>– “O Sole Mio” — Neapolitan song<br>– A. Piazzolla — “Tango”<br>– A. Piazzolla — “Libertango”<br>– J. Brahms — Hungarian Dance No. 5<br>– D. Shuplevski — “Capriccio” No. 1</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator -->\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\"/>\n<!-- /wp:separator -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>– Enrique Iglesias — “Hero” (arr. E. Bogoevska)<br>– ABBA — “Mamma Mia”<br>– ABBA — “Money, Money, Money”<br>– Ben E. King — “Stand By Me”<br>– Michael Jackson — Compilation<br>(Smooth Criminal &amp; Somebody’s Watching Me)</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Trio Aurora has been active and successfully performing for four years. The founder and first violin is the young and acclaimed violinist Eva Bogoevska, winner of numerous first international prizes and the Grand Prix at the International Festival of Classical Art and Culture in Jerusalem, Israel. The second violinist is Ljubica Deleva, and the cellist is Oleg Cingarski. The trio has performed at many events, embassy concerts, anniversaries, charity concerts, and cultural TV programs.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Eva Bogoevska (born 27.10.1999, Skopje) began winning major international awards early in her career. She won first prizes at festivals and competitions in Italy, Russia, Israel, and the USA, including the Grand Prix in Jerusalem and first prize at the Rondo International Competition in New York, followed by a performance at Carnegie Hall. She has appeared as a soloist with the Macedonian Philharmonic and the National Opera and Ballet Orchestra in Ho Chi Minh City, and has performed across Europe, Asia, and the USA. She is also a member of the FAMES Film Orchestra.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Ljubica Deleva (born 16.09.1995) is a fourth-year student at the Faculty of Music Arts in Skopje in the class of Prof. Oleg Kondratenko. She is a laureate of several national and international competitions and has performed as a soloist with the Macedonian Philharmonic and at major festivals. She is a member of FAMES and collaborates with the Macedonian Opera and Ballet and the Macedonian Philharmonic.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Oleg Cingarski (born 2001, Skopje) began his music education at age nine at DMBUC “Ilija Nikolovski–Luj,” studying cello with Prof. Dragan Gonevski. He has won multiple prizes at national and international competitions in Macedonia, Serbia, Bulgaria, and the Czech Republic, and has attended numerous masterclasses and seminars across the region.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":2656} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img src=\"http://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2018/06/Eva-Bogoevska-violin.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-2656\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":2659} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img src=\"http://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2018/06/%D0%95%D0%B2%D0%B0-%D0%91%D0%BE%D0%B3%D0%BE%D0%B5%D0%B2%D1%81%D0%BA%D0%B0.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-2659\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":2660} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img src=\"http://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2018/06/%D0%89%D1%83%D0%B1%D0%B8%D1%86%D0%B0-%D0%94%D0%B5%D0%BB%D0%B5%D0%B2%D0%B0.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-2660\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":2661} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img src=\"http://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2018/06/%D0%9E%D0%BB%D0%B5%D0%B3-%D0%A6%D0%B8%D0%BD%D0%B3%D0%B0%D1%80%D1%81%D0%BA%D0%B8-1024x681.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-2661\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->','CONCERT – TRIO AURORA11.06.2018 (MONDAY) — SMALL HALL — 20:00','','publish','open','open','','concert-trio-aurora11-06-2018-monday-small-hall-2000','','','2026-02-08 18:53:21','2026-02-08 18:53:21','',0,'https://user17.delovna.finki.ukim.mk/?p=1063',0,'post','',0);
INSERT INTO `wp_posts` VALUES (1064,1,'2026-02-08 18:53:20','2026-02-08 18:53:20','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>05/06/2018</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:image -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img src=\"https://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2018/06/TELOP-AURORA.jpg\" alt=\"\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>TRIO AURORA</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Eva Bogoevska — violin<br>Ljubica Deleva — violin<br>Oleg Cingarski — cello</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>PROGRAM</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>– W. A. Mozart — “A Little Night Music”<br>• Allegro<br>• Romance (Andante)<br>• Menuet (Allegretto)<br>• Rondo (Allegro)<br>– L. Boccherini — “Minuet”<br>– J. Pachelbel — “Canon”<br>– “O Sole Mio” — Neapolitan song<br>– A. Piazzolla — “Tango”<br>– A. Piazzolla — “Libertango”<br>– J. Brahms — Hungarian Dance No. 5<br>– D. Shuplevski — “Capriccio” No. 1</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator -->\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\"/>\n<!-- /wp:separator -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>– Enrique Iglesias — “Hero” (arr. E. Bogoevska)<br>– ABBA — “Mamma Mia”<br>– ABBA — “Money, Money, Money”<br>– Ben E. King — “Stand By Me”<br>– Michael Jackson — Compilation<br>(Smooth Criminal &amp; Somebody’s Watching Me)</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Trio Aurora has been active and successfully performing for four years. The founder and first violin is the young and acclaimed violinist Eva Bogoevska, winner of numerous first international prizes and the Grand Prix at the International Festival of Classical Art and Culture in Jerusalem, Israel. The second violinist is Ljubica Deleva, and the cellist is Oleg Cingarski. The trio has performed at many events, embassy concerts, anniversaries, charity concerts, and cultural TV programs.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Eva Bogoevska (born 27.10.1999, Skopje) began winning major international awards early in her career. She won first prizes at festivals and competitions in Italy, Russia, Israel, and the USA, including the Grand Prix in Jerusalem and first prize at the Rondo International Competition in New York, followed by a performance at Carnegie Hall. She has appeared as a soloist with the Macedonian Philharmonic and the National Opera and Ballet Orchestra in Ho Chi Minh City, and has performed across Europe, Asia, and the USA. She is also a member of the FAMES Film Orchestra.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Ljubica Deleva (born 16.09.1995) is a fourth-year student at the Faculty of Music Arts in Skopje in the class of Prof. Oleg Kondratenko. She is a laureate of several national and international competitions and has performed as a soloist with the Macedonian Philharmonic and at major festivals. She is a member of FAMES and collaborates with the Macedonian Opera and Ballet and the Macedonian Philharmonic.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Oleg Cingarski (born 2001, Skopje) began his music education at age nine at DMBUC “Ilija Nikolovski–Luj,” studying cello with Prof. Dragan Gonevski. He has won multiple prizes at national and international competitions in Macedonia, Serbia, Bulgaria, and the Czech Republic, and has attended numerous masterclasses and seminars across the region.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":2656} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img src=\"http://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2018/06/Eva-Bogoevska-violin.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-2656\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":2659} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img src=\"http://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2018/06/%D0%95%D0%B2%D0%B0-%D0%91%D0%BE%D0%B3%D0%BE%D0%B5%D0%B2%D1%81%D0%BA%D0%B0.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-2659\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":2660} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img src=\"http://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2018/06/%D0%89%D1%83%D0%B1%D0%B8%D1%86%D0%B0-%D0%94%D0%B5%D0%BB%D0%B5%D0%B2%D0%B0.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-2660\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":2661} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img src=\"http://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2018/06/%D0%9E%D0%BB%D0%B5%D0%B3-%D0%A6%D0%B8%D0%BD%D0%B3%D0%B0%D1%80%D1%81%D0%BA%D0%B8-1024x681.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-2661\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->','CONCERT – TRIO AURORA11.06.2018 (MONDAY) — SMALL HALL — 20:00','','inherit','closed','closed','','1063-revision-v1','','','2026-02-08 18:53:20','2026-02-08 18:53:20','',1063,'https://user17.delovna.finki.ukim.mk/?p=1064',0,'revision','',0);
INSERT INTO `wp_posts` VALUES (1065,1,'2026-02-08 18:54:00','2026-02-08 18:54:00','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>29/05/2018</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:image -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img src=\"https://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2018/05/%D0%A8%D0%BA%D0%BE%D0%BB%D0%B0-%D0%B7%D0%B0-%D0%BF%D0%B8%D1%98%D0%B0%D0%BD%D0%BE-02.jpg\" alt=\"\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Редовен Годишен Концерт на ученици од Школата за пијано под раководство на проф. Марија Тодоровска и доделување на дипломи.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>ПРОГРАМА</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>1. ПЕТРА ЗЛАТЕВСКА – подготвителна настава<br>– Француски песна&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<br>– Детска француска песна&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<br>-Алует-француска песна</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>2. ЃОРЃИ ЗЛАТЕВСКИ – I год.<br>– Ода на радоста, -Блуз скала&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<br>– Фанданго, – Во земјата на џуџињата</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>3. АНДРЕЈ ДИМИТРИЕВСКИ I-год.&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<br>– Во куќата на духовите , – Ла распа&nbsp;<br>– Мазурка, – Лебедово езеро&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<br>– Комичен танц, – Тарантела</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>4. ДОРА ДИМОВСКА – II год.<br>– Приспивна песна – Ј.Брамс<br>– На убавиот син Дунав – Ј.Штраус<br>– Романса – В.А.Моцарт</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>5. МИЛА ЈОВАНОВСКА – III год.<br>– О соле мио<br>– Мексиканска песна&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<br>– Американска песна</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>6. ЛИНА ЈОВАНОВСКА – V год.<br>– Тиролски валцер<br>– Танц на малите лебеди<br>– Тарантела&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>7. ЈОВАНА МАНИЌ – IV год.&nbsp;<br>-Унгарски танц – Ј.Брамс<br>-Л.в.Бетовен – Месечева соната – II и III став</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>8. МАГДАЛЕНА ЛАЗАРЕВА – VII год.<br>-Танго – И. Албенис<br>– Пиеса – Л.в.Бетовен<br>– Ф.Шопен – Валцер – цис-мол</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','ГОДИШЕН КОНЦЕРТ НА УЧЕНИЦИ ОД ШКОЛА ЗА ПИЈАНО – ПРОФ. МАРИЈА ТОДОРОВСКА ВТОРНИК 05.06.2018 МАЛА САЛА 20ч.','','publish','open','open','','%d0%b3%d0%be%d0%b4%d0%b8%d1%88%d0%b5%d0%bd-%d0%ba%d0%be%d0%bd%d1%86%d0%b5%d1%80%d1%82-%d0%bd%d0%b0-%d1%83%d1%87%d0%b5%d0%bd%d0%b8%d1%86%d0%b8-%d0%be%d0%b4-%d1%88%d0%ba%d0%be%d0%bb%d0%b0-%d0%b7%d0%b0','','','2026-02-08 18:54:00','2026-02-08 18:54:00','',0,'https://user17.delovna.finki.ukim.mk/?p=1065',0,'post','',0);
