2.jpg 1024w, https://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/2-4-300x200.jpg 300w, https://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/2-4-768x512.jpg 768w, https://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/2-4.jpg 1040w\">&nbsp;<img src=\"http://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/3-4.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"640\" height=\"427\" srcset=\"https://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/3-4.jpg 1000w, https://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/3-4-300x200.jpg 300w, https://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/3-4-768x512.jpg 768w\"></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','Меѓународен фестивал „ДЕНОВИ НА ПРОЗАТА“','','inherit','closed','closed','','1121-revision-v1','','','2026-02-13 22:48:30','2026-02-13 22:48:30','',1121,'https://user17.delovna.finki.ukim.mk/?p=1122',0,'revision','',0);
INSERT INTO `wp_posts` VALUES (1124,1,'2026-02-13 22:48:59','2026-02-13 22:48:59','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>24/04/2023</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:image -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img src=\"https://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/12.jpg\" alt=\"\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We are honored to announce some of this year’s participants at the International Prose Festival in Kumanovo.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Vlada Urošević – Republic of North Macedonia 🇲🇰<br>Danica Vukićević – Republic of Serbia 🇷🇸<br>Elena Aleksieva – Republic of Bulgaria 🇧🇬</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The full Festival program with all participants will be announced soon.<br>See you on May 25 and 26 at the Center for Culture.<img width=\"640\" height=\"360\" srcset=\"https://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/1-4-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/1-4-300x169.jpg 300w, https://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/1-4-768x432.jpg 768w, https://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/1-4.jpg 1248w\" src=\"http://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/1-4-1024x576.jpg\" alt=\"\"> <img width=\"640\" height=\"426\" srcset=\"https://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/2-4-1024x682.jpg 1024w, https://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/2-4-300x200.jpg 300w, https://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/2-4-768x512.jpg 768w, https://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/2-4.jpg 1040w\" src=\"http://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/2-4-1024x682.jpg\" alt=\"\"> <img width=\"640\" height=\"427\" srcset=\"https://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/3-4.jpg 1000w, https://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/3-4-300x200.jpg 300w, https://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/3-4-768x512.jpg 768w\" src=\"http://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/3-4.jpg\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','International Festival “Days of Prose”','','publish','open','open','','international-festival-days-of-prose','','','2026-02-13 22:49:00','2026-02-13 22:49:00','',0,'https://user17.delovna.finki.ukim.mk/?p=1124',0,'post','',0);
INSERT INTO `wp_posts` VALUES (1125,1,'2026-02-13 22:48:59','2026-02-13 22:48:59','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>24/04/2023</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:image -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img src=\"https://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/12.jpg\" alt=\"\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We are honored to announce some of this year’s participants at the International Prose Festival in Kumanovo.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Vlada Urošević – Republic of North Macedonia 🇲🇰<br>Danica Vukićević – Republic of Serbia 🇷🇸<br>Elena Aleksieva – Republic of Bulgaria 🇧🇬</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The full Festival program with all participants will be announced soon.<br>See you on May 25 and 26 at the Center for Culture.<img width=\"640\" height=\"360\" srcset=\"https://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/1-4-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/1-4-300x169.jpg 300w, https://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/1-4-768x432.jpg 768w, https://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/1-4.jpg 1248w\" src=\"http://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/1-4-1024x576.jpg\" alt=\"\"> <img width=\"640\" height=\"426\" srcset=\"https://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/2-4-1024x682.jpg 1024w, https://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/2-4-300x200.jpg 300w, https://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/2-4-768x512.jpg 768w, https://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/2-4.jpg 1040w\" src=\"http://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/2-4-1024x682.jpg\" alt=\"\"> <img width=\"640\" height=\"427\" srcset=\"https://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/3-4.jpg 1000w, https://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/3-4-300x200.jpg 300w, https://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/3-4-768x512.jpg 768w\" src=\"http://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/3-4.jpg\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','International Festival “Days of Prose”','','inherit','closed','closed','','1124-revision-v1','','','2026-02-13 22:48:59','2026-02-13 22:48:59','',1124,'https://user17.delovna.finki.ukim.mk/?p=1125',0,'revision','',0);
INSERT INTO `wp_posts` VALUES (1126,1,'2026-02-13 22:49:51','2026-02-13 22:49:51','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>24/04/2023</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Ве очекуваме во вторник.<br>Во фоаје на Центар за култура.<br>Од 18:00 часот.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Збирката содржи 64 хаи[бун]накуа, што симболички ја претставуваат годината на раѓање на авторката 1964, којашто, пак, е година на змејот во земјите што го следат кинескиот хороскоп.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Дијана Петкова е родена во Скопје. Дипломирала на Филолошкиот факултет во Скопје, на групата Македонски јазик со историја на книжевностите на југословенските народи. Нејзината поезија е објавувана во списанијата „Современост“ „Стожер“ и „ТЕА Модерна“ и хрватското списание „Ирис“, а застапена е во антологијата „Отчукување на срцето во македонската поезија“ од Светлана Христова-Јоциќ (2012), во зборникот „Надреалистички гугилипапули“ со поезија и кратки раскази (2016), во Зборникот на Поетски слем Македонија (2021 и 2022), како и во повеќе е-збирки.<img src=\"http://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/13-1.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"679\" height=\"960\" srcset=\"https://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/13-1.jpg 679w, https://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/13-1-212x300.jpg 212w\"></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','Промоција на книгата „Скротителка на змејови“','','publish','open','open','','%d0%bf%d1%80%d0%be%d0%bc%d0%be%d1%86%d0%b8%d1%98%d0%b0-%d0%bd%d0%b0-%d0%ba%d0%bd%d0%b8%d0%b3%d0%b0%d1%82%d0%b0-%d1%81%d0%ba%d1%80%d0%be%d1%82%d0%b8%d1%82%d0%b5%d0%bb%d0%ba%d0%b0-%d0%bd%d0%b0','','','2026-02-13 22:49:51','2026-02-13 22:49:51','',0,'https://user17.delovna.finki.ukim.mk/?p=1126',0,'post','',0);
INSERT INTO `wp_posts` VALUES (1127,1,'2026-02-13 22:49:26','2026-02-13 22:49:26','','image_2026-02-13_234925702','','inherit','open','closed','','image_2026-02-13_234925702','','','2026-02-13 22:49:26','2026-02-13 22:49:26','',1126,'https://user17.delovna.finki.ukim.mk/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/image_2026-02-13_234925702.png',0,'attachment','image/png',0);
INSERT INTO `wp_posts` VALUES (1128,1,'2026-02-13 22:49:51','2026-02-13 22:49:51','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>24/04/2023</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Ве очекуваме во вторник.<br>Во фоаје на Центар за култура.<br>Од 18:00 часот.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Збирката содржи 64 хаи[бун]накуа, што симболички ја претставуваат годината на раѓање на авторката 1964, којашто, пак, е година на змејот во земјите што го следат кинескиот хороскоп.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Дијана Петкова е родена во Скопје. Дипломирала на Филолошкиот факултет во Скопје, на групата Македонски јазик со историја на книжевностите на југословенските народи. Нејзината поезија е објавувана во списанијата „Современост“ „Стожер“ и „ТЕА Модерна“ и хрватското списание „Ирис“, а застапена е во антологијата „Отчукување на срцето во македонската поезија“ од Светлана Христова-Јоциќ (2012), во зборникот „Надреалистички гугилипапули“ со поезија и кратки раскази (2016), во Зборникот на Поетски слем Македонија (2021 и 2022), како и во повеќе е-збирки.<img src=\"http://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/13-1.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"679\" height=\"960\" srcset=\"https://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/13-1.jpg 679w, https://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/13-1-212x300.jpg 212w\"></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','Промоција на книгата „Скротителка на змејови“','','inherit','closed','closed','','1126-revision-v1','','','2026-02-13 22:49:51','2026-02-13 22:49:51','',1126,'https://user17.delovna.finki.ukim.mk/?p=1128',0,'revision','',0);
INSERT INTO `wp_posts` VALUES (1129,1,'2026-02-13 22:50:17','2026-02-13 22:50:17','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>24/04/2023</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We are expecting you on Tuesday,<br>in the foyer of the Center for Culture,<br>starting at 18:00.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The collection contains 64 haibun pieces, symbolically representing the author’s birth year — 1964 — which is the Year of the Dragon in countries that follow the Chinese zodiac.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Dijana Petkova was born in Skopje. She graduated from the Faculty of Philology in Skopje, Department of Macedonian Language with History of South Slavic Literatures. Her poetry has been published in the magazines <em>Sovremenost</em>, <em>Stozher</em>, <em>TEA Moderna</em>, and the Croatian magazine <em>Iris</em>. She is also represented in the anthology <em>Heartbeat in Macedonian Poetry</em> by Svetlana Hristova-Jocić (2012), in the collection <em>Surrealist Googlipapuli</em> with poetry and short stories (2016), in the Poetry Slam Macedonia collections (2021 and 2022), as well as in several e-collections.<img width=\"679\" height=\"960\" srcset=\"https://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/13-1.jpg 679w, https://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/13-1-212x300.jpg 212w\" src=\"http://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/13-1.jpg\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','Book Promotion: “Dragon Tamer”','','publish','open','open','','book-promotion-dragon-tamer','','','2026-02-13 22:50:17','2026-02-13 22:50:17','',0,'https://user17.delovna.finki.ukim.mk/?p=1129',0,'post','',0);
INSERT INTO `wp_posts` VALUES (1130,1,'2026-02-13 22:50:17','2026-02-13 22:50:17','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>24/04/2023</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We are expecting you on Tuesday,<br>in the foyer of the Center for Culture,<br>starting at 18:00.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The collection contains 64 haibun pieces, symbolically representing the author’s birth year — 1964 — which is the Year of the Dragon in countries that follow the Chinese zodiac.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Dijana Petkova was born in Skopje. She graduated from the Faculty of Philology in Skopje, Department of Macedonian Language with History of South Slavic Literatures. Her poetry has been published in the magazines <em>Sovremenost</em>, <em>Stozher</em>, <em>TEA Moderna</em>, and the Croatian magazine <em>Iris</em>. She is also represented in the anthology <em>Heartbeat in Macedonian Poetry</em> by Svetlana Hristova-Jocić (2012), in the collection <em>Surrealist Googlipapuli</em> with poetry and short stories (2016), in the Poetry Slam Macedonia collections (2021 and 2022), as well as in several e-collections.<img width=\"679\" height=\"960\" srcset=\"https://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/13-1.jpg 679w, https://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/13-1-212x300.jpg 212w\" src=\"http://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/13-1.jpg\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','Book Promotion: “Dragon Tamer”','','inherit','closed','closed','','1129-revision-v1','','','2026-02-13 22:50:17','2026-02-13 22:50:17','',1129,'https://user17.delovna.finki.ukim.mk/?p=1130',0,'revision','',0);
INSERT INTO `wp_posts` VALUES (1131,1,'2026-02-13 22:51:16','2026-02-13 22:51:16','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>24/04/2023</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>23 април </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Светски ден на книгата и авторското право.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>– Помисли добро пред нешто да дадеш, помисли два пати пред нешто да примиш, а илјада пати пред нешто да побараш.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Мигел де Сервантес.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":5602} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img src=\"http://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/12-1-1024x682.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-5602\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->','Светски ден на книгата и авторското право','','publish','open','open','','%d1%81%d0%b2%d0%b5%d1%82%d1%81%d0%ba%d0%b8-%d0%b4%d0%b5%d0%bd-%d0%bd%d0%b0-%d0%ba%d0%bd%d0%b8%d0%b3%d0%b0%d1%82%d0%b0-%d0%b8-%d0%b0%d0%b2%d1%82%d0%be%d1%80%d1%81%d0%ba%d0%be%d1%82%d0%be-%d0%bf%d1%80','','','2026-02-13 22:51:17','2026-02-13 22:51:17','',0,'https://user17.delovna.finki.ukim.mk/?p=1131',0,'post','',0);
