ри.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>“…Среќните народи и луѓе, со големините се среќаваат во дробното, и малото во големините го пронаоѓаат. Нивното внимание се протега до границите на сонот, перцепцијата им е померена преку меѓите секојдневни; нивните светови за многумина се неразбирливи, а само среќните можат во нив да ѕирнат и да се восхитат на глетките непоимливи; но дури кога тие први го посакаат тоа, и кога допуштат. Тие ја заплеткуваат и размрсуваат стварноста, од нив може сешто да се очекува; па дури и оние со секакви сетила надарени понекогаш бидат затечени, изненадени и запрепастени. Тие всушност, а и самото име така им кажува – творци се викани – само лијат, повторуваат и се обидуваат да ги приближат матриците до нас обичните, честопати несвесни. Понекогаш, тие, на за нас сфатлив начин, се обидуваат да ги објаснат замислите и проекциите на Создавањето. На она вистинското, единствено што го востановил Создателот лично.<br>Тие се посредници помеѓу Него и нас обичните и грешни; покрај нив, и ние сме поблизу до Него, иако само на ниво на восхит за делото Негово…“</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Белград, 19 октомври 2016<br><strong>Душан Миловановиќ</strong>, историчар на уметноста</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','ИЗЛОЖБА – РАЈКО Р. КАРИШИЌ – ФОТОГРАФИИ – 28.06.2018 ЧЕТВРТОК ИЗЛОЖБЕН САЛОН 20ч.','','inherit','closed','closed','','1329-revision-v1','','','2026-02-14 18:53:12','2026-02-14 18:53:12','',1329,'https://user17.delovna.finki.ukim.mk/?p=1331',0,'revision','',0);
INSERT INTO `wp_posts` VALUES (1332,1,'2026-02-14 18:53:53','2026-02-14 18:53:53','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>19/06/2018</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:image -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img src=\"https://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2018/06/rajko-karisic-pokana.jpg\" alt=\"\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong> Rajko R. Karišić</strong> was born on 05.11.1952 in Bačko Dobro Polje, Municipality of Vrbas.<br>He graduated from the Faculty of Mechanical Engineering at the University of Novi Sad. He began working in photography in April 1973 at the Photo-Cine Club “Mašinac” at the Faculty of Mechanical Engineering in Novi Sad.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>So far he has had around 100 solo exhibitions in his country and abroad: Belgrade 1998, 2003, 2008, 2011; Zaječar 2005; Kotor 2005; Pale 2007; Novi Sad, Vrbas, Kula, Kikinda, Sirogojno, Petrovac na Mlavi, Negotin, Niš 2010; Čigota – Zlatibor 2003, 2011; Moscow (Russia) 2010 as part of the VIII International Photography Biennale; Novi Bečej 2011; The Đura Jakšić House in Belgrade 2011, 2015; Gevgelija 2011, 2013, 2015; Kavadarci (Macedonia) 2015; Saint Petersburg (Russia) 2012; Loznica 2012, 2014; Aleksandrovac Župski 2013; Novi Bečej 2013; “Gallery 73” in Belgrade 2014; RTS Gallery in Belgrade 2015; CLU “Guarnerius,” Belgrade 2015. He has also participated in over two hundred group exhibitions in his country as well as in Canada, Austria, Spain, Romania, Hungary, Montenegro, Macedonia, Republika Srpska, and others.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>He holds the high title Candidate Master of Photography from the Photo Association of Serbia and Montenegro. He has produced 98 author books and one photo monograph. In addition, he has prepared and realized 21 mini-monographs of monasteries and churches of the Serbian Orthodox Church. He has also contributed to more than 10 other monographs and created over 100 catalogs and posters for his own exhibitions, exhibitions of well-known painters, and catalogs for art colonies and gatherings. He has actively participated in more than 80 art colonies and gatherings.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>“…Fortunate peoples and individuals encounter greatness in the small, and discover the small within greatness. Their attention extends to the borders of dreams; their perception moves beyond everyday limits. Their worlds are incomprehensible to many, and only the fortunate can glimpse into them and admire the unimaginable sights — but only when they themselves wish it and allow it. They entangle and unravel reality; anything can be expected from them. Even those gifted with every kind of sense can sometimes be caught off guard, surprised, and astonished. In fact — as their very name says — they are called creators — they pour, repeat, and try to bring the patterns closer to us ordinary, often unaware people. Sometimes, in ways understandable to us, they try to explain the ideas and projections of Creation — the true one, the only one established by the Creator Himself. They are intermediaries between Him and us, the ordinary and flawed; beside them, we too are closer to Him, even if only at the level of admiration for His work…”</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Belgrade, October 19, 2016<br><strong>Dušan Milovanović</strong>, art historian</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','EXHIBITION – RAJKO R. KARIŠIĆ – PHOTOGRAPHS – 28.06.2018 (THURSDAY) EXHIBITION SALON 20:00','','publish','open','open','','exhibition-rajko-r-karisic-photographs-28-06-2018-thursday-exhibition-salon-2000','','','2026-02-14 18:53:53','2026-02-14 18:53:53','',0,'https://user17.delovna.finki.ukim.mk/?p=1332',0,'post','',0);
INSERT INTO `wp_posts` VALUES (1333,1,'2026-02-14 18:53:53','2026-02-14 18:53:53','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>19/06/2018</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:image -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img src=\"https://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2018/06/rajko-karisic-pokana.jpg\" alt=\"\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong> Rajko R. Karišić</strong> was born on 05.11.1952 in Bačko Dobro Polje, Municipality of Vrbas.<br>He graduated from the Faculty of Mechanical Engineering at the University of Novi Sad. He began working in photography in April 1973 at the Photo-Cine Club “Mašinac” at the Faculty of Mechanical Engineering in Novi Sad.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>So far he has had around 100 solo exhibitions in his country and abroad: Belgrade 1998, 2003, 2008, 2011; Zaječar 2005; Kotor 2005; Pale 2007; Novi Sad, Vrbas, Kula, Kikinda, Sirogojno, Petrovac na Mlavi, Negotin, Niš 2010; Čigota – Zlatibor 2003, 2011; Moscow (Russia) 2010 as part of the VIII International Photography Biennale; Novi Bečej 2011; The Đura Jakšić House in Belgrade 2011, 2015; Gevgelija 2011, 2013, 2015; Kavadarci (Macedonia) 2015; Saint Petersburg (Russia) 2012; Loznica 2012, 2014; Aleksandrovac Župski 2013; Novi Bečej 2013; “Gallery 73” in Belgrade 2014; RTS Gallery in Belgrade 2015; CLU “Guarnerius,” Belgrade 2015. He has also participated in over two hundred group exhibitions in his country as well as in Canada, Austria, Spain, Romania, Hungary, Montenegro, Macedonia, Republika Srpska, and others.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>He holds the high title Candidate Master of Photography from the Photo Association of Serbia and Montenegro. He has produced 98 author books and one photo monograph. In addition, he has prepared and realized 21 mini-monographs of monasteries and churches of the Serbian Orthodox Church. He has also contributed to more than 10 other monographs and created over 100 catalogs and posters for his own exhibitions, exhibitions of well-known painters, and catalogs for art colonies and gatherings. He has actively participated in more than 80 art colonies and gatherings.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>“…Fortunate peoples and individuals encounter greatness in the small, and discover the small within greatness. Their attention extends to the borders of dreams; their perception moves beyond everyday limits. Their worlds are incomprehensible to many, and only the fortunate can glimpse into them and admire the unimaginable sights — but only when they themselves wish it and allow it. They entangle and unravel reality; anything can be expected from them. Even those gifted with every kind of sense can sometimes be caught off guard, surprised, and astonished. In fact — as their very name says — they are called creators — they pour, repeat, and try to bring the patterns closer to us ordinary, often unaware people. Sometimes, in ways understandable to us, they try to explain the ideas and projections of Creation — the true one, the only one established by the Creator Himself. They are intermediaries between Him and us, the ordinary and flawed; beside them, we too are closer to Him, even if only at the level of admiration for His work…”</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Belgrade, October 19, 2016<br><strong>Dušan Milovanović</strong>, art historian</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','EXHIBITION – RAJKO R. KARIŠIĆ – PHOTOGRAPHS – 28.06.2018 (THURSDAY) EXHIBITION SALON 20:00','','inherit','closed','closed','','1332-revision-v1','','','2026-02-14 18:53:53','2026-02-14 18:53:53','',1332,'https://user17.delovna.finki.ukim.mk/?p=1333',0,'revision','',0);
INSERT INTO `wp_posts` VALUES (1334,1,'2026-02-14 18:54:34','2026-02-14 18:54:34','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>06/07/2018</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:image -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img src=\"https://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2018/07/KICEVSKA-KOLONIJA.jpg\" alt=\"\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>24 – та Интернационална Кичевска Ликовна Колонија во Куманово</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/robert.cvetkovski.39\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">ROBERT CVETKOVSKI</a>·<a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/notes/robert-cvetkovski/24-%D1%82%D0%B0-%D0%B8%D0%BD%D1%82%D0%B5%D1%80%D0%BD%D0%B0%D1%86%D0%B8%D0%BE%D0%BD%D0%B0%D0%BB%D0%BD%D0%B0-%D0%BA%D0%B8%D1%87%D0%B5%D0%B2%D1%81%D0%BA%D0%B0-%D0%BB%D0%B8%D0%BA%D0%BE%D0%B2%D0%BD%D0%B0-%D0%BA%D0%BE%D0%BB%D0%BE%D0%BD%D0%B8%D1%98%D0%B0-%D0%B2%D0%BE-%D0%BA%D1%83%D0%BC%D0%B0%D0%BD%D0%BE%D0%B2%D0%BE/10155487494586881/\">НЕДЕЛА, 08 ЈУЛИ 2018</a><a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/notes/robert-cvetkovski/24-%D1%82%D0%B0-%D0%B8%D0%BD%D1%82%D0%B5%D1%80%D0%BD%D0%B0%D1%86%D0%B8%D0%BE%D0%BD%D0%B0%D0%BB%D0%BD%D0%B0-%D0%BA%D0%B8%D1%87%D0%B5%D0%B2%D1%81%D0%BA%D0%B0-%D0%BB%D0%B8%D0%BA%D0%BE%D0%B2%D0%BD%D0%B0-%D0%BA%D0%BE%D0%BB%D0%BE%D0%BD%D0%B8%D1%98%D0%B0-%D0%B2%D0%BE-%D0%BA%D1%83%D0%BC%D0%B0%D0%BD%D0%BE%D0%B2%D0%BE/10155487494586881/#\"></a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>На 12.07.2018 г. / четврток / со почеток во 20 часот во Изложбениот салон на НУ Центар за култура “Трајко Прокопиев“ – Куманово ќе биде отворена реномираната 24- та Интернационална Кичевска Ликовна Колонија. Изложбата содржи триесеттина дела работени во летните месеци во 2017 год. а учество зедоа следните автори:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Жарко Јакимовски – Македонија</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Весела Стаменова – Бугарија</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Павел Василев – Бугарија</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Никола Ненадиќ – Хрватска</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Marat Bekeyev – Kazahstan</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Akmaral Zhiyengaliyeva – Kazahstan</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Feridun Ishiman – S.Kipar</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Ahmet Erman Karagoz – S.Kipar</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Poonam Chandrika Tyagi – Indija</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Madan Lal – Indija</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Lulzime Osmani – Makedonija</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Слободан Милошески – Македонија</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Anita Monoscalco – Italija</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Hala El Sharouny – Egipet</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Pervin Ghorbanzadeh – Iran</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Anze Gallus Petelin – Slovenija</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Costin Brateanu – Romanija</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Jashar Calli – Turcija</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Belgin Akin – Turcija</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Vesna Sekulic – Kosovo</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Vesna Opavski – Srbija</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Изложбата во Куманово ќе биде поставена до 26 јули.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><img src=\"http://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2018/07/36758186_10204657446552968_6367690582877274112_o-1024x612.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"640\" height=\"383\" srcset=\"https://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2018/07/36758186_10204657446552968_63676905828772