rawings, indicating her artistic interests and affinities.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The exhibition “Beginning” is an expansion of those first attempts at artistic self-discovery and the search for a defined stylistic expression, both thematically and technically. Hence the heterogeneous collection of works with multidirectional tendencies and broadly defined goals, which are expected to gain clearer specialization and definition over time. Such a state is entirely normal for artists who are just beginning to write their first visual “sentences” through sketches and paintings filled with a wide spectrum of ideas and solutions.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>What can be stated with certainty is the young author’s clear affinity and desire to present her talent and drawing-painting abilities in the best possible way, showing equal interest in drawing solutions and coloristic executions — ranging from realistic figurative approaches to abstract-expressive compositions with strong color contrast and a wide palette.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>This broad thematic and technical range shows her interest in both figurative and abstract art, which also suggests a wide starting position for self-exploration and positioning on the local art scene. In her drawings, one can feel a passion for animals and portraits, as well as a strong need to apply her own elements (flowers, butterflies, floral and geometric polychrome elements, deconstructed backgrounds with pseudo-perspective, etc.) in order to develop original solutions that would later define her authorial expression.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>In the abstract-associative paintings, we can observe a sense for color contrast and expressive use of color as an emotional record of a momentary psychological state. Overall, we note a fine beginning of what is hoped to be a creative artistic future filled with new and fresh authorial solutions, focused ideas, and a high technical level of execution, considering the predispositions of the artist Žaklina Denkovska.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Robert Cvetkovski, art historian на уметноста</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','09.05.2019 (THURSDAY) 20:00 – EXHIBITION – ŽAKLINA DENKOVSKA “Beginning” – Drawings and Paintings','','inherit','closed','closed','','1413-revision-v1','','','2026-02-14 19:17:29','2026-02-14 19:17:29','',1413,'https://user17.delovna.finki.ukim.mk/?p=1414',0,'revision','',0);
