i>Емилија и Стојче Тоциновски, Скопје</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Јана Илиевска, Стајковци, Скопје</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Лазар Ангелков, Велес</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Оливер Цветковски, Велес</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Тоде Блажевски, Скопје</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Илко Стојановски, Велес</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Александра Ристевски, Скопје</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Андреј Ангелковиќ, Куманово</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Ѓорги Антевски, Куманово</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Елхида Елезовска, Куманово</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Милан Милиќ, Скопје</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Васил Гаврилов, Велес</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Мирко Бојаџиевски, Скопје</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Александар Стеванов, Штип</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Катерина Тери Николовска , Скопје</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Марија Стојановска, Скопје</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->','ИЗЛОЖБА НА МАКЕДОНСКИ СТРИП АВТОРИ – 19.09.2019 (ЧЕТВРТОК) ИЗЛОЖБЕН САЛОН 20ч.','','inherit','closed','closed','','1440-revision-v1','','','2026-02-14 19:26:38','2026-02-14 19:26:38','',1440,'https://user17.delovna.finki.ukim.mk/?p=1442',0,'revision','',0);
INSERT INTO `wp_posts` VALUES (1443,1,'2026-02-14 19:27:04','2026-02-14 19:27:04','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>13/09/2019</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:image -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img src=\"https://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2019/09/STRIP-PLAKAT-1.jpg\" alt=\"\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The Comic Center of Macedonia, based in Veles, was founded in 2002 as a continuation of the ASSOCIATION OF COMIC ENTHUSIASTS “STRIP ART” (established in 1995).</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Its goals are to:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>revive and promote Macedonian comics in various communities both within and outside the country<br>encourage organization and cooperation among comic creators in Macedonia<br>promote and practically apply the possibilities that comics offer in different areas of society</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>CCM Veles organizes and initiates numerous activities through:<br>a) Library activity (with a fund of more than 10,000 comic titles)<br>b) Publishing activity (16 issues of the comic magazine STRIP ART and 25 issues of the comic magazine KREATOR — the only continuous comic publication in the country since 2003 — where Macedonian authors continuously publish their works, including many debut pieces, as well as comic albums)<br>c) Exhibition activity (group, solo, and thematic exhibitions) in various cities in Macedonia and abroad<br>d) Educational activity, including many comic workshops with beginners and established artists<br>e) International activity — continuous networking between Macedonian comic authors and international comic creators<br>f) Advocacy activity before state institutions, media, and the public to improve conditions for the Macedonian comic scene</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The activity “Exhibition of Macedonian Comic Authors” is implemented by the National Institution Center for Culture “Trajko Prokopiev” Kumanovo at the initiative of the Macedonian Comic Center, and is included in the Annual Program of the Ministry of Culture of the Republic of North Macedonia for 2019 in the field of Visual Arts, Architecture, and Design.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The goal is to promote Macedonian comic culture and comic artists from different generations across the country.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Exhibition participants:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Jordančo Davidovski – Kumanovo<br>Predrag Gjorgiovski – Kumanovo<br>Miško Hrdlička – Kumanovo<br>Ljupčo Filipov – Skopje<br>Mile Topuz – Skopje<br>Dime Ivanov–Dimano – Skopje<br>Vane Trajkov – Veles<br>Ana Marija Stefanoska – Skopje<br>Angela Petruševska – Skopje<br>Jana Buteska – Skopje<br>Emilija and Stojče Tocinovski – Skopje<br>Jana Ilievska – Stajkovci, Skopje<br>Lazar Angelkov – Veles<br>Oliver Cvetkovski – Veles<br>Tode Blaževski – Skopje<br>Ilko Stojanovski – Veles<br>Aleksandra Ristevski – Skopje<br>Andrej Angelković – Kumanovo<br>Gjorgi Antevski – Kumanovo<br>Elhida Elezovska – Kumanovo<br>Milan Milić – Skopje<br>Vasil Gavrilov – Veles<br>Mirko Bojadžievski – Skopje<br>Aleksandar Stevanov – Štip<br>Katerina Teri Nikolovska – Skopje<br>Marija Stojanovska – Skopje</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','EXHIBITION OF MACEDONIAN COMIC ARTISTS – 19.09.2019 (THURSDAY) EXHIBITION SALON 20:00','','publish','open','open','','exhibition-of-macedonian-comic-artists-19-09-2019-thursday-exhibition-salon-2000','','','2026-02-14 19:27:04','2026-02-14 19:27:04','',0,'https://user17.delovna.finki.ukim.mk/?p=1443',0,'post','',0);
INSERT INTO `wp_posts` VALUES (1444,1,'2026-02-14 19:27:04','2026-02-14 19:27:04','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>13/09/2019</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:image -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img src=\"https://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2019/09/STRIP-PLAKAT-1.jpg\" alt=\"\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The Comic Center of Macedonia, based in Veles, was founded in 2002 as a continuation of the ASSOCIATION OF COMIC ENTHUSIASTS “STRIP ART” (established in 1995).</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Its goals are to:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>revive and promote Macedonian comics in various communities both within and outside the country<br>encourage organization and cooperation among comic creators in Macedonia<br>promote and practically apply the possibilities that comics offer in different areas of society</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>CCM Veles organizes and initiates numerous activities through:<br>a) Library activity (with a fund of more than 10,000 comic titles)<br>b) Publishing activity (16 issues of the comic magazine STRIP ART and 25 issues of the comic magazine KREATOR — the only continuous comic publication in the country since 2003 — where Macedonian authors continuously publish their works, including many debut pieces, as well as comic albums)<br>c) Exhibition activity (group, solo, and thematic exhibitions) in various cities in Macedonia and abroad<br>d) Educational activity, including many comic workshops with beginners and established artists<br>e) International activity — continuous networking between Macedonian comic authors and international comic creators<br>f) Advocacy activity before state institutions, media, and the public to improve conditions for the Macedonian comic scene</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The activity “Exhibition of Macedonian Comic Authors” is implemented by the National Institution Center for Culture “Trajko Prokopiev” Kumanovo at the initiative of the Macedonian Comic Center, and is included in the Annual Program of the Ministry of Culture of the Republic of North Macedonia for 2019 in the field of Visual Arts, Architecture, and Design.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The goal is to promote Macedonian comic culture and comic artists from different generations across the country.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Exhibition participants:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Jordančo Davidovski – Kumanovo<br>Predrag Gjorgiovski – Kumanovo<br>Miško Hrdlička – Kumanovo<br>Ljupčo Filipov – Skopje<br>Mile Topuz – Skopje<br>Dime Ivanov–Dimano – Skopje<br>Vane Trajkov – Veles<br>Ana Marija Stefanoska – Skopje<br>Angela Petruševska – Skopje<br>Jana Buteska – Skopje<br>Emilija and Stojče Tocinovski – Skopje<br>Jana Ilievska – Stajkovci, Skopje<br>Lazar Angelkov – Veles<br>Oliver Cvetkovski – Veles<br>Tode Blaževski – Skopje<br>Ilko Stojanovski – Veles<br>Aleksandra Ristevski – Skopje<br>Andrej Angelković – Kumanovo<br>Gjorgi Antevski – Kumanovo<br>Elhida Elezovska – Kumanovo<br>Milan Milić – Skopje<br>Vasil Gavrilov – Veles<br>Mirko Bojadžievski – Skopje<br>Aleksandar Stevanov – Štip<br>Katerina Teri Nikolovska – Skopje<br>Marija Stojanovska – Skopje</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','EXHIBITION OF MACEDONIAN COMIC ARTISTS – 19.09.2019 (THURSDAY) EXHIBITION SALON 20:00','','inherit','closed','closed','','1443-revision-v1','','','2026-02-14 19:27:04','2026-02-14 19:27:04','',1443,'https://user17.delovna.finki.ukim.mk/?p=1444',0,'revision','',0);
INSERT INTO `wp_posts` VALUES (1445,1,'2026-02-14 19:27:36','2026-02-14 19:27:36','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>18/09/2019</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:image -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img src=\"https://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2019/09/KK-PLAKAT.jpg\" alt=\"\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>25</strong><strong>-та</strong>&nbsp;<strong>Интернационална Кичевска ликовна колонија во Куманово</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>На 26.09.2019 г. /четврток/, &nbsp;со почеток во 20 часот во Изложбениот салон на НУ Центар за култура “Трајко Прокопиев“ – Куманово ќе биде отворена изложба на слики од&nbsp;</strong><strong>25</strong><strong>-та Интернационална Кичевска ликовна колонија</strong>. На оваа реномирана колонија којашто се организира во “Куќата на уметноста“ на локалитетот Кнежино (Кичево), на 25-тото издание (2018 г.) учество зедоа дваесетина уметници од земјата и странство. Делата во најголем број се слики работени во техниката масло и акрил на платно но има и графики и скулптури. Колонијата е под покровителство на АД “Тајмиште“ – Кичево и во својата колекција има преку 900 дела. Претставувањето на 25-та Интернационална Кичевска ликовна колонија во Куманово е дел од Годишната програма подржана од страна на Министерството за култура на РС Македонија и истата ќе биде поставена за целиот период на времетраењето на Меѓународниот фестивал “Денови на комедијата 2019“ ( до 15.10.2019).</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','ИЗЛОЖБА – 25 ИНТЕРНАЦИОНАЛНА КИЧЕВСКА ЛИКОВНА КОЛОНИЈА 26.09.2019 (ЧЕТВРТОК) ИЗЛОЖБЕН САЛОН 20ч.','','publish','open','open','','%d0%b8%d0%b7%d0%bb%d0%be%d0%b6%d0%b1%d0%b0-25-%d0%b8%d0%bd%d1%82%d0%b5%d1%80%d0%bd%d0%b0%d1%86%d0%b8%d0%be%d0%bd%d0%b0%d0%bb%d0%bd%d0%b0-%d0%ba%d0%b8%d1%87%d0%b5%d0%b2%d1%81%d0%ba%d0%b0','','','2026-02-14 19:27:36','2026-02-14 19:27:36','',0,'https://user17.delovna.finki.ukim.mk/?p=1445',0,'post','',0);
INSERT INTO `wp_posts` VALUES (1446,1,'2026-02-14 19:27:21','2026-02-14 19:27:21','','image_2026-02-14_202721074','','inherit','open','closed','','image_2026-02-14_202721074','','','2026-02-14 19:27:21','2026-02-14 19:27:21','',1445,'https://user17.delovna.finki.ukim.mk/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/image_2026-02-14_202721074.png',0,'attachment','image/png',0);
INSERT INTO `wp_posts` VALUES (1447,1,'2026-02-14 19:27:36','2026-02-14 19:27:36','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>18/09/2019</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:image -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img src=\"https://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2019/09/KK-PLAKAT.jpg\" alt=\"\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>25</strong><strong>-та</strong>&nbsp;<strong>Интернационална Кичевска ликовна колонија во Куманово</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>На 26.09.2019 г. /четврток/, &nbsp;со почеток во 20 часот во Изложбениот салон на НУ Центар за култура “Трајко Прокопиев“ – Куманово ќе биде отворена изложба на слики од&nbsp;</strong><strong>25</strong><strong>-та Интернационална Кичевска ликовна колонија</strong>. На оваа реномирана колонија којашто се организира во “Куќата на уметноста“ на локалитетот Кнежино (Кичево), на 25-тото издание (2018 г.) учество зедоа дваесетина уметници од земјата и странство. Делата во најголем број се слики работени во техниката масло и акрил на платно но има и графики и скулптури. Колонијата е под покровителство на АД “Тајмиште“ – Кичево и во својата колекција има преку 900 дела. Претставувањето на 25-та Интернационална Кичевска ликовна колонија во Куманово е дел од Годишната програма подржана од страна на Министерството за култура на РС Македонија и истата ќе биде поставена за целиот период на времетраењето на Меѓународниот фестивал “Денови на комедијата 2019“ ( до 15.10.2019).</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','ИЗЛОЖБА – 25 ИНТЕРНАЦИОНАЛНА КИЧЕВСКА ЛИКОВНА КОЛОНИЈА 26.09.2019 (ЧЕТВРТОК) ИЗЛОЖБЕН САЛОН 20ч.','','inherit','closed','closed','','1445-revision-v1','','','2026-02-14 19:27:36','2026-02-14 19:27:36','',1445,'https://user17.delovna.finki.ukim.mk/?p=1447',0,'revision','',0);
INSERT INTO `wp_posts` VALUES (1448,1,'2026-02-14 19:27:55','2026-02-14 19:27:55','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>18/09/2019</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:image -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img src=\"https://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2019/09/KK-PLAKAT.jpg\" alt=\"\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>25th International Kičevo Art Colony in Kumanovo</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>On 26.09.2019 (Thursday), starting at 20:00, at the Exhibition Salon of the National Institution Center for Culture “Trajko Prokopiev” – Kumanovo, an exhibition of paintings from the 25th International Kičevo Art Colony will be opened.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>At this renowned colony, organized at the “House of Art” at the Knežino locality (Kičevo), around twenty artists from the country and abroad participated in the 25th edition (2018). Most of the works are paintings created in oil and acrylic on canvas, but there are also prints and sculptures.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The colony is under the patronage of AD “Tajmište” – Kičevo and holds a collection of over 900 works. The presentation of the 25th International Kičevo Art Colony in Kumanovo is part of the Annual Program supported by the Ministry of Culture of the Republic of North Macedonia and will remain on display for the entire duration of the International Festival “Days of Comedy 2019” (until 15.10.2019).</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','EXHIBITION – 25th INTERNATIONAL KIČEVO ART COLONY – 26.09.2019 (THURSDAY) EXHIBITION SALON 20:00','','publish','open','open','','exhibition-25th-international-kicevo-art-colony-26-09-2019-thursday-exhibition-salon-2000','','','2026-02-14 19:27:55','2026-02-14 19:27:55','',0,'https://user17.delovna.finki.ukim.mk/?p=1448',0,'post','',0);
INSERT INTO `wp_posts` VALUES (1449,1,'2026-02-14 19:27:55','2026-02-14 19:27:55','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>18/09/2019</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:image -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img src=\"https://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2019/09/KK-PLAKAT.jpg\" alt=\"\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>25th International Kičevo Art Colony in Kumanovo</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>On 26.09.2019 (Thursday), starting at 20:00, at the Exhibition Salon of the National Institution Center for Culture “Trajko Prokopiev” – Kumanovo, an exhibition of paintings from the 25th International Kičevo Art Colony will be opened.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>At this renowned colony, organized at the “House of Art” at the Knežino locality (Kičevo), around twenty artists from the country and abroad participated in the 25th edition (2018). Most of the works are paintings created in oil and acrylic on canvas, but there are also prints and sculptures.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The colony is under the patronage of AD “Tajmište” – Kičevo and holds a collection of over 900 works. The presentation of the 25th International Kičevo Art Colony in Kumanovo is part of the Annual Program supported by the Ministry of Culture of the Republic of North Macedonia and will remain on display for the entire duration of the International Festival “Days of Comedy 2019” (until 15.10.2019).</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','EXHIBITION – 25th INTERNATIONAL KIČEVO ART COLONY – 26.09.2019 (THURSDAY) EXHIBITION SALON 20:00','','inherit','closed','closed','','1448-revision-v1','','','2026-02-14 19:27:55','2026-02-14 19:27:55','',1448,'https://user17.delovna.finki.ukim.mk/?p=1449',0,'revision','',0);
INSERT INTO `wp_posts` VALUES (1450,1,'2026-02-14 19:28:23','2026-02-14 19:28:23','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>08/10/2019</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:image -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img src=\"https://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2019/10/%D0%9F%D0%9B%D0%90%D0%9A%D0%90%D0%A2-%D0%A1%D0%A2.jpg\" alt=\"\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Оваа година колонијата се<br>одржуваше од 1 до 12 август во која учествуваа 14 ликовни уметници<br>од земјата и странство и тоа од Русија, Полска, Бугарија, Грција, Америка, Србија,и Македонија.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>12 топли творечки креативни денови, поминати во една позитивна атмосфера,<br>творејќи секој по своите чувства, емоции и доживувања, се создадоа 40-тина нови<br>дела, со кои фондот на струмичката колонија се збогати уште<br>повеќе. 56 години традиција, преку 1300 ликовни творци од цел<br>свет кои се учествувале, создадени повеќе од 2600 дела.<br>Големо богатство е да се има дела од основополозниците на македонското<br>современо сликарство, Пандилов, Мартиновски, Владимирски, Наумовски, Кондовски,<br>Мазев, Чемерски, Куновски и уште многу други, ликовни уметници кои оставиле дел од своето срце,</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','ИЗЛОЖБА – 56 МЕЃУНАРОДНА СТРУМИЧКА ЛИКОВНА КОЛОНИЈА – 2019 17.10.2019 (ЧЕТВРТОК) 20ч.','','publish','open','open','','%d0%b8%d0%b7%d0%bb%d0%be%d0%b6%d0%b1%d0%b0-56-%d0%bc%d0%b5%d1%93%d1%83%d0%bd%d0%b0%d1%80%d0%be%d0%b4%d0%bd%d0%b0-%d1%81%d1%82%d1%80%d1%83%d0%bc%d0%b8%d1%87%d0%ba%d0%b0-%d0%bb%d0%b8%d0%ba','','','2026-02-14 19:28:23','2026-02-14 19:28:23','',0,'https://user17.delovna.finki.ukim.mk/?p=1450',0,'post','',0);
INSERT INTO `wp_posts` VALUES (1451,1,'2026-02-14 19:28:10','2026-02-14 19:28:10','','image_2026-02-14_202810128','','inherit','open','closed','','image_2026-02-14_202810128','','','2026-02-14 19:28:10','2026-02-14 19:28:10','',1450,'https://user17.delovna.finki.ukim.mk/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/image_2026-02-14_202810128.png',0,'attachment','image/png',0);
INSERT INTO `wp_posts` VALUES (1452,1,'2026-02-14 19:28:23','2026-02-14 19:28:23','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>08/10/2019</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:image -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img src=\"https://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2019/10/%D0%9F%D0%9B%D0%90%D0%9A%D0%90%D0%A2-%D0%A1%D0%A2.jpg\" alt=\"\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Оваа година колонијата се<br>одржуваше од 1 до 12 август во која учествуваа 14 ликовни уметници<br>од земјата и странство и тоа од Русија, Полска, Бугарија, Грција, Америка, Србија,и Македонија.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>12 топли творечки креативни денови, поминати во една позитивна атмосфера,<br>творејќи секој по своите чувства, емоции и доживувања, се создадоа 40-тина нови<br>дела, со кои фондот на струмичката колонија се збогати уште<br>повеќе. 56 години традиција, преку 1300 ликовни творци од цел<br>свет кои се учествувале, создадени повеќе од 2600 дела.<br>Големо богатство е да се има дела од основополозниците на македонското<br>современо сликарство, Пандилов, Мартиновски, Владимирски, Наумовски, Кондовски,<br>Мазев, Чемерски, Куновски и уште многу други, ликовни уметници кои оставиле дел од своето срце,</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','ИЗЛОЖБА – 56 МЕЃУНАРОДНА СТРУМИЧКА ЛИКОВНА КОЛОНИЈА – 2019 17.10.2019 (ЧЕТВРТОК) 20ч.','','inherit','closed','closed','','1450-revision-v1','','','2026-02-14 19:28:23','2026-02-14 19:28:23','',1450,'https://user17.delovna.finki.ukim.mk/?p=1452',0,'revision','',0);
INSERT INTO `wp_posts` VALUES (1453,1,'2026-02-14 19:28:39','2026-02-14 19:28:39','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>08/10/2019</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:image -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img src=\"https://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2019/10/%D0%9F%D0%9B%D0%90%D0%9A%D0%90%D0%A2-%D0%A1%D0%A2.jpg\" alt=\"\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>This year the colony was held from August 1 to August 12, with the participation of 14 visual artists from the country and abroad — from Russia, Poland, Bulgaria, Greece, the United States, Serbia, and Macedonia.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>During 12 warm and creatively productive days spent in a positive atmosphere, with each artist creating according to their own feelings, emotions, and experiences, around forty new works were produced, further enriching the Strumica colony collection.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>With 56 years of tradition, more than 1,300 visual artists from around the world have participated, creating over 2,600 works. It is a great treasure to possess works by the founders of modern Macedonian painting — Pandilov, Martinoski, Vladimirski, Naumovski, Kondovski, Mazev, Čemerski, Kunovski, and many other visual artists who have left a part of their heart in these creations.воето срце,</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','EXHIBITION – 56th INTERNATIONAL STRUMICA ART COLONY – 2019 – 17.10.2019 (THURSDAY) 20:00','','publish','open','open','','exhibition-56th-international-strumica-art-colony-2019-17-10-2019-thursday-2000','','','2026-02-14 19:28:39','2026-02-14 19:28:39','',0,'https://user17.delovna.finki.ukim.mk/?p=1453',0,'post','',0);
INSERT INTO `wp_posts` VALUES (1454,1,'2026-02-14 19:28:39','2026-02-14 19:28:39','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>08/10/2019</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:image -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img src=\"https://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2019/10/%D0%9F%D0%9B%D0%90%D0%9A%D0%90%D0%A2-%D0%A1%D0%A2.jpg\" alt=\"\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>This year the colony was held from August 1 to August 12, with the participation of 14 visual artists from the country and abroad — from Russia, Poland, Bulgaria, Greece, the United States, Serbia, and Macedonia.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>During 12 warm and creatively productive days spent in a positive atmosphere, with each artist creating according to their own feelings, emotions, and experiences, around forty new works were produced, further enriching the Strumica colony collection.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>With 56 years of tradition, more than 1,300 visual artists from around the world have participated, creating over 2,600 works. It is a great treasure to possess works by the founders of modern Macedonian painting — Pandilov, Martinoski, Vladimirski, Naumovski, Kondovski, Mazev, Čemerski, Kunovski, and many other visual artists who have left a part of their heart in these creations.воето срце,</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','EXHIBITION – 56th INTERNATIONAL STRUMICA ART COLONY – 2019 – 17.10.2019 (THURSDAY) 20:00','','inherit','closed','closed','','1453-revision-v1','','','2026-02-14 19:28:39','2026-02-14 19:28:39','',1453,'https://user17.delovna.finki.ukim.mk/?p=1454',0,'revision','',0);
INSERT INTO `wp_posts` VALUES (1455,1,'2026-02-14 19:29:07','2026-02-14 19:29:07','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>16/10/2019</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:image -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img src=\"https://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2019/10/%D0%BF%D0%BE%D0%BA%D0%B0%D0%BD%D0%B0-%D0%92%D0%BB%D0%B0%D1%82%D0%BA%D0%BE.jpg\" alt=\"\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Во четврток на 24 октомври во Центарот за култура Трајко Прокопиев во Куманово со почеток во 20:00 часот ќе биде отворена изложбата на фотографии Прага интима&nbsp; на фотографот Влатко Деков.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>„Прага интима“ е личен, интимен портрет на еден од најубавите градови во светот, Прага. На трагите на она што го работеше познатиот чешки фотограф, Јосеф Судек, „Прага интима“ ги доловува скриените, вонвременски делови на градот, најчесто без присуство на луѓе. Проектот е работен 2 години, период во кој авторот ја посетува Прага 5 пати, живее и ја фотографира&nbsp; вкупно 44 денови, во текот на летниот и во зимскиот период.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Ќе бидат изложени 34 црно бели фотографии. Воедно ќе биде промовирана и фото книга со истото име како и изложбата.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Изложбата е финансирана од Министерството за култура на Република Северна Македонија, а книгата е во издание на Издавачката куќа ИЛИ ИЛИ од Скопје.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','ИЗЛОЖБА НА ФОТОГРАФИИ и ПРОМОЦИЈА НА КНИГА: “ПРАГА ИНТИМА“ од ВЛАТКО ДЕКОВ 24.10.2019 (четврток) ИЗЛОЖБЕН САЛОН 20ч.','','publish','open','open','','%d0%b8%d0%b7%d0%bb%d0%be%d0%b6%d0%b1%d0%b0-%d0%bd%d0%b0-%d1%84%d0%be%d1%82%d0%be%d0%b3%d1%80%d0%b0%d1%84%d0%b8%d0%b8-%d0%b8-%d0%bf%d1%80%d0%be%d0%bc%d0%be%d1%86%d0%b8%d1%98%d0%b0-%d0%bd%d0%b0-%d0%ba-2','','','2026-02-14 19:29:08','2026-02-14 19:29:08','',0,'https://user17.delovna.finki.ukim.mk/?p=1455',0,'post','',0);
