жба на дигитални графички дела','','inherit','closed','closed','','1597-revision-v1','','','2026-02-14 21:15:39','2026-02-14 21:15:39','',1597,'https://user17.delovna.finki.ukim.mk/?p=1599',0,'revision','',0);
INSERT INTO `wp_posts` VALUES (1600,1,'2026-02-14 21:16:16','2026-02-14 21:16:16','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>03/05/2023</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:image -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img src=\"https://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/8.jpg\" alt=\"\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>You are invited to the exhibition <strong>“Graphic Stories”</strong> – an exhibition by Stefan Jakimovski, on May 18 at 19:30, in the foyer of the Trajko Prokopiev Center for Culture in Kumanovo.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Stefan Jakimovski is an artist who, through the presentation and expression of his works, shifts the boundaries between the real and the imaginary, constantly searching for new visual interpretations that follow and fit into modern artistic trends. His works are understandable and simple, yet perfectly integrated into a unified artistic whole.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Stefan Jakimovski is a full professor at the Faculty of Design and Multimedia at AUE-FON University and the founder of the Graphic Design department at the same faculty. By invitation, he delivers guest lectures at Balkan University – Skopje and Mother Teresa University – Skopje, and has completed a research visit at the IT University of Copenhagen, Denmark, at the Department of Digital Design.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>He teaches courses in graphics, graphic design, typography, poster design, corporate communication, and more. He is the author of many graphic solutions and a participant in international competitions, symposiums, and exhibitions. Jakimovski serves as a member of several professional jury committees, a reviewer of vocational education textbooks, and a mentor for curricular and extracurricular projects. He has received numerous awards and recognitions for his work.<img width=\"640\" height=\"244\" srcset=\"https://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/8-1024x390.jpg 1024w, https://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/8-300x114.jpg 300w, https://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/8-768x292.jpg 768w\" src=\"http://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/8-1024x390.jpg\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','Exhibition of Digital Graphic Works','','publish','open','open','','exhibition-of-digital-graphic-works','','','2026-02-14 21:16:17','2026-02-14 21:16:17','',0,'https://user17.delovna.finki.ukim.mk/?p=1600',0,'post','',0);
INSERT INTO `wp_posts` VALUES (1601,1,'2026-02-14 21:16:16','2026-02-14 21:16:16','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>03/05/2023</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:image -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img src=\"https://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/8.jpg\" alt=\"\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>You are invited to the exhibition <strong>“Graphic Stories”</strong> – an exhibition by Stefan Jakimovski, on May 18 at 19:30, in the foyer of the Trajko Prokopiev Center for Culture in Kumanovo.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Stefan Jakimovski is an artist who, through the presentation and expression of his works, shifts the boundaries between the real and the imaginary, constantly searching for new visual interpretations that follow and fit into modern artistic trends. His works are understandable and simple, yet perfectly integrated into a unified artistic whole.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Stefan Jakimovski is a full professor at the Faculty of Design and Multimedia at AUE-FON University and the founder of the Graphic Design department at the same faculty. By invitation, he delivers guest lectures at Balkan University – Skopje and Mother Teresa University – Skopje, and has completed a research visit at the IT University of Copenhagen, Denmark, at the Department of Digital Design.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>He teaches courses in graphics, graphic design, typography, poster design, corporate communication, and more. He is the author of many graphic solutions and a participant in international competitions, symposiums, and exhibitions. Jakimovski serves as a member of several professional jury committees, a reviewer of vocational education textbooks, and a mentor for curricular and extracurricular projects. He has received numerous awards and recognitions for his work.<img width=\"640\" height=\"244\" srcset=\"https://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/8-1024x390.jpg 1024w, https://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/8-300x114.jpg 300w, https://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/8-768x292.jpg 768w\" src=\"http://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/8-1024x390.jpg\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','Exhibition of Digital Graphic Works','','inherit','closed','closed','','1600-revision-v1','','','2026-02-14 21:16:16','2026-02-14 21:16:16','',1600,'https://user17.delovna.finki.ukim.mk/?p=1601',0,'revision','',0);
