а претставата. Дали Таа да го бакне или да му удри шамар, дали Тој или Таа да одговори на повикот од неговата бивша жена – одлучувате вие по пат на гласање во живо!</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":3240} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img src=\"http://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2018/10/FNX_4601-1024x683.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-3240\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":3241} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img src=\"http://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2018/10/FNX_4677-1024x683.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-3241\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":3242} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img src=\"http://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2018/10/FNX_4705-1024x683.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-3242\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":3243} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img src=\"http://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2018/10/FNX_4739-1024x683.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-3243\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":3244} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img src=\"http://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2018/10/FNX_4756-1024x683.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-3244\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->','4.10. (НЕДЕЛА) 20ч. ПРОДУКЦИЈА ТЕАТАР “КРИК“ СКОПЈЕ','','inherit','closed','closed','','1715-revision-v1','','','2026-02-14 22:11:28','2026-02-14 22:11:28','',1715,'https://user17.delovna.finki.ukim.mk/?p=1717',0,'revision','',0);
INSERT INTO `wp_posts` VALUES (1718,1,'2026-02-14 22:12:04','2026-02-14 22:12:04','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>12/10/2018</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:image -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img src=\"https://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2018/10/42269557_2212105598803949_1733845277686628352_n.jpg\" alt=\"\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Due to technical problems of the Strumica Theater team, Theater “KRIK” Skopje will perform with the play:</strong><br><strong>“First You’ll Take Me, Then You’ll…”</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Director: Gjorgji Rizeski<br>Set Design: Robert Ristov<br>Costume Design: Elena Luka<br>Production: Theater KRIK</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Cast:<br>Gjorgji Muchev – Robert Ristov<br>Keti Mjau Sokolovska – Mirjana Popovska Ristov<br>The Waiter/Host – Darko Veljic</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>“First You’ll Take Me, Then You’ll…” is the first real show in Comedy Theater.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The play takes place here and now, in real time, during a one-evening blind date between the proofreader Keti Mjau Sokolovska and the veterinarian Gjorgji Muchev.<br>He – a man with an unsuccessful marriage behind him, determined never to marry again and seeing this meeting only as a one-night adventure.<br>She – a woman who has already made a decision – to get married at this meeting, that very same evening.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>This is the only performance where you, the audience, are active participants in directing the play. Whether she kisses him or slaps him, whether he or she answers the call from his ex-wife — you decide by live voting.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":3240} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img src=\"http://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2018/10/FNX_4601-1024x683.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-3240\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":3241} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img src=\"http://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2018/10/FNX_4677-1024x683.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-3241\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":3242} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img src=\"http://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2018/10/FNX_4705-1024x683.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-3242\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":3243} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img src=\"http://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2018/10/FNX_4739-1024x683.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-3243\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":3244} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img src=\"http://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2018/10/FNX_4756-1024x683.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-3244\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->','14.10 (SUNDAY) 20:00 – Theater “KRIK” Skopje','','publish','open','open','','14-10-sunday-2000-theater-krik-skopje','','','2026-02-14 22:12:05','2026-02-14 22:12:05','',0,'https://user17.delovna.finki.ukim.mk/?p=1718',0,'post','',0);
