лтернативен Театар „Отпишани“ – Скопје:<br>Петра Ивановска – во улога на гласот на Александра<br>Ивана Стамевска – во улога на духот на Александра<br>Марјан Анѓеловски – во улога на Веселин<br>Јасмин Рамани – во улога на Горјан<br>Огнен Велевски – во улога на Ева.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Претставата е поддржана од<br>Министерството за култура, како проект од национален интерес од областа на драмската дејност за 2021 година.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Цената на влезницата е 150 денари.<br>Поради ограничен број на места, резервирајте ја Вашата влезница на телефонскиот број 078/208-443.<br>Влезниците можете да ги набавите во билетарата на НУЦК „Трајко Прокопиев“ – Куманово, секој работен ден од 10:00 до 14:00 и од 17:00 до 20:00 часот.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Напомена: Претставата е за лица постари од 16 години.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Се гледаме на претстава. Никако не го пропуштајте овој одличен настан!<img src=\"http://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/20-1024x576.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"640\" height=\"360\" srcset=\"https://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/20-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/20-300x169.jpg 300w, https://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/20-768x432.jpg 768w\"></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','„Самоубиство во самоодбрана“ – Театарска претстава','','inherit','closed','closed','','1791-revision-v1','','','2026-02-15 21:00:36','2026-02-15 21:00:36','',1791,'https://user17.delovna.finki.ukim.mk/?p=1793',0,'revision','',0);
INSERT INTO `wp_posts` VALUES (1794,1,'2026-02-15 21:00:59','2026-02-15 21:00:59','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>05/04/2023</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:image -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img src=\"https://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/20.jpg\" alt=\"\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Dear ladies and gentlemen,<br>The play that has won five international awards across the Balkans — premiering in Kumanovo!!!</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>It is our great pleasure to invite you to the theatre play “Suicide in Self-Defense,” based on the dramatic text of the same name by Marjan Anđelovski, directed by Aleksandar Jovanovski and Marjan Anđelovski.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>“Suicide in Self-Defense” is a drama about life, humanity, love, and fear. The main storyline takes place at a railway station where Veselin is waiting for the train he intends to throw himself under. There he seemingly accidentally meets the self-proclaimed poet Gorjan and the trans woman Eva. This line is intertwined with memories from his past, through which we learn the reasons that led him to this final station. The cards are revealed, the masks fall, the truth comes to light…</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>“Written masterfully, seemingly light and effortless, yet in fact multilayered, the drama ‘Suicide in Self-Defense’ hides powerful messages and criticism beneath the surface — both toward society and toward the individual as its basic unit. This kind of critique, delivered through humor, irony, and parody, is exactly what people burdened by everyday modern life need.”<br>— Snežana Stojčevska</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The scenography is by Riste Micevski. The roles are performed by actors from the Alternative Theatre “The Outcasts” – Skopje:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Petra Ivanovska — as the Voice of Aleksandra</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Ivana Stamevska — as the Spirit of Aleksandra</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Marjan Anđelovski — as Veselin</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Jasmin Ramani — as Gorjan</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Ognen Velevski — as Eva</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The play is supported by the Ministry of Culture as a project of national interest in the field of drama for 2021.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Ticket price: 150 denars.<br>Due to limited seating, reserve your ticket at: +389 78 208 443.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Tickets are available at the ticket office of NUCC “Trajko Prokopiev” – Kumanovo, every working day from 10:00–14:00 and 17:00–20:00.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Note: The play is intended for audiences aged 16+.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>See you at the performance — don’t miss this excellent event!<img width=\"640\" height=\"360\" srcset=\"https://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/20-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/20-300x169.jpg 300w, https://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/20-768x432.jpg 768w\" src=\"http://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/20-1024x576.jpg\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','“Suicide in Self-Defense” – Theatre Play','','publish','open','open','','suicide-in-self-defense-theatre-play','','','2026-02-15 21:01:00','2026-02-15 21:01:00','',0,'https://user17.delovna.finki.ukim.mk/?p=1794',0,'post','',0);
INSERT INTO `wp_posts` VALUES (1795,1,'2026-02-15 21:00:59','2026-02-15 21:00:59','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>05/04/2023</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:image -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img src=\"https://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/20.jpg\" alt=\"\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Dear ladies and gentlemen,<br>The play that has won five international awards across the Balkans — premiering in Kumanovo!!!</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>It is our great pleasure to invite you to the theatre play “Suicide in Self-Defense,” based on the dramatic text of the same name by Marjan Anđelovski, directed by Aleksandar Jovanovski and Marjan Anđelovski.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>“Suicide in Self-Defense” is a drama about life, humanity, love, and fear. The main storyline takes place at a railway station where Veselin is waiting for the train he intends to throw himself under. There he seemingly accidentally meets the self-proclaimed poet Gorjan and the trans woman Eva. This line is intertwined with memories from his past, through which we learn the reasons that led him to this final station. The cards are revealed, the masks fall, the truth comes to light…</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>“Written masterfully, seemingly light and effortless, yet in fact multilayered, the drama ‘Suicide in Self-Defense’ hides powerful messages and criticism beneath the surface — both toward society and toward the individual as its basic unit. This kind of critique, delivered through humor, irony, and parody, is exactly what people burdened by everyday modern life need.”<br>— Snežana Stojčevska</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The scenography is by Riste Micevski. The roles are performed by actors from the Alternative Theatre “The Outcasts” – Skopje:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Petra Ivanovska — as the Voice of Aleksandra</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Ivana Stamevska — as the Spirit of Aleksandra</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Marjan Anđelovski — as Veselin</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Jasmin Ramani — as Gorjan</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Ognen Velevski — as Eva</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The play is supported by the Ministry of Culture as a project of national interest in the field of drama for 2021.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Ticket price: 150 denars.<br>Due to limited seating, reserve your ticket at: +389 78 208 443.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Tickets are available at the ticket office of NUCC “Trajko Prokopiev” – Kumanovo, every working day from 10:00–14:00 and 17:00–20:00.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Note: The play is intended for audiences aged 16+.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>See you at the performance — don’t miss this excellent event!<img width=\"640\" height=\"360\" srcset=\"https://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/20-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/20-300x169.jpg 300w, https://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/20-768x432.jpg 768w\" src=\"http://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/20-1024x576.jpg\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','“Suicide in Self-Defense” – Theatre Play','','inherit','closed','closed','','1794-revision-v1','','','2026-02-15 21:00:59','2026-02-15 21:00:59','',1794,'https://user17.delovna.finki.ukim.mk/?p=1795',0,'revision','',0);
INSERT INTO `wp_posts` VALUES (1796,1,'2026-02-15 21:01:56','2026-02-15 21:01:56','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>05/04/2023</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"width\":\"388px\",\"height\":\"auto\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image is-resized\"><img src=\"https://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:388px;height:auto\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Најавуваме.<br>Гостување на Драматично – куклениот театар Иван Радоев од Плевен, Република Бугарија.<br>Со претставата „Еден маж и една жена“<br>На 31 мај во Центар за култура Куманово.<br>По текст на Валентин Красногоров<br>режисер: Анастас Попдимитров<br>сценографија и костими: Мария Диманова<br>играат: Мариета Калпова, Георги Ангелов</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Што се случува кога една голема женска жртва и силна машка страст ќе се судрат вплетувајќи се во судбината на еден маж и една жена.<br>Преку комични и тажни однесувања на сцена излегуваат комплетно спротивставени емоции – од нежна блискост и топлина, до големо спротивставување.<br>Дали заедно ќе се препуштат на среќата, која е толку близу до нив, дали секој од нив ќе го направи нужниот компромис или ќе се препуштат на спокојството на самотијата.<img src=\"http://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"453\" height=\"640\" srcset=\"https://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/21.jpg 453w, https://nucktrajkoprokopiev.mk/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/21-212x300.jpg 212w\"></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','Театарска претстава „Еден маж и една жена“','','publish','open','open','','%d1%82%d0%b5%d0%b0%d1%82%d0%b0%d1%80%d1%81%d0%ba%d0%b0-%d0%bf%d1%80%d0%b5%d1%82%d1%81%d1%82%d0%b0%d0%b2%d0%b0-%d0%b5%d0%b4%d0%b5%d0%bd-%d0%bc%d0%b0%d0%b6-%d0%b8-%d0%b5%d0%b4%d0%bd%d0%b0','','','2026-02-15 21:01:56','2026-02-15 21:01:56','',0,'https://user17.delovna.finki.ukim.mk/?p=1796',0,'post','',0);
